\Cref{fig:real} reports real-world results. On seen tasks, LLM-backbone methods outperform RT-1 and Diffusion Policy, with UP-VLA competitive or best. On unseen-object grasping UP-VLA-RT-2 outperforms UP-VLA-phi-w/o-mmu, indicating that semantic knowledge helps novel objects, while UP-VLA is best overall. On precision tasks the order reverses (UP-VLA-phi-w/o-mmu above UP-VLA-RT-2), indicating that future prediction supplies spatial detail, and UP-VLA is again best.

